{"id":"80321c8440894526","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-readability.md","title":"Readability as minimum maximum variable occurrence","display":"df-readability — Readability as minimum maximum variable occurrence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-readability","aliases":["27-df-readability"],"display":"df-readability — Readability as minimum maximum variable occurrence","depends_on":["[[27-df-readonceexpr]]","[[27-df-boolexpr]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.7.1 Readability","source_printed_pages":"476","source_pdf_pages":"500","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-constant-convention"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-readability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-readability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-readability — Readability as minimum maximum variable occurrence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b55c3b5cc4413e57\" href=\"?note=b55c3b5cc4413e57\" title=\"27-df-readonceexpr\">27-df-readonceexpr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.7.1 Readability"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"476"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"500"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-constant-convention"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{occ}_i\">\\(\\mathrm{occ}_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b55c3b5cc4413e57\" href=\"?note=b55c3b5cc4413e57\" title=\"27-df-readonceexpr\">27-df-readonceexpr</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\\emptyset=0\">\\(\\max\\emptyset=0\\)</span>。下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Read}_m(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Read}_m(n)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{read}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{read}(f)\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Read}_m(n)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\;\n(\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)=f\\land\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)\\le m))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Read}_m(n)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\;\n(\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)=f\\land\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)\\le m))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{read}(f)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\left\\{\\max(\\{\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)\\mid i\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{0\\})\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\ \\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)=f\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{read}(f)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\left\\{\\max(\\{\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)\\mid i\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{0\\})\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\ \\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)=f\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Read}_m(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{read}(f)\\le m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Read}_m(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{read}(f)\\le m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10.7.1，印刷 p.476／PDF p.500。最小化集合非空，因为每个布尔函数有有限DNF；自然数良序保证最小值。出现次数依语法而非真值等价类计算。沿本目录常量语法约定允许m=0，常函数readability为0；非恒定时与书中通常从1起的定义一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-readonceexpr","status":"resolved","id":"b55c3b5cc4413e57","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-readonceexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","headi