ity as minimum maximum variable occurrence]]"},{"id":"8c84f69fd256e6ce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 且 $\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\ne f(y))$；$G(f)=(V,E)$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]，$\\mathrm{read}$ 见 [[27-df-readability]]。$r\\in V$，$p:V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\to V$，$h:V\\to\\{0,\\ldots,|V|-1\\}$，满足\n$E=\\{\\{v,p(v)\\}:v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\}$、$h(r)=0$、$\\forall v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;(h(v)=h(p(v))+1)$。\n这些条件给出以 $r$ 为根的树的父点及深度数据；孩子集 $C(v)$ 由下式定义。空析取为 $0$。"}],"outgoing":["b55c3b5cc4413e57","f3101a1c9df92f67"]}